          "_name": "features019",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features19\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Card</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Images\" name=\"showImages\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Center Image\" name=\"centerAlign\" condition=\"showImages\" checked>\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"12\" selected>1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Cards BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#232323\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<b>Recommendations</b></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Check out my <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/thomaskrueger/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a> profile for additional recommendations</h5>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb active\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bharathbushan.jpeg\" alt data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Bharath Bushan</b><br>Senior Software Engineer</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">I had the opportunity to work directly with Tom for over 4 years. He is an empathetic leader. Coaching and mentoring engineers comes natural to him. He is a strong technical leader with a big emphasis on software architecture and documentation. While he managed several engineers and helped their career advancement, he was also technically competent to write code(.NET, C#, Java/Kotlin with Android) when needed. He is passionate about solving problems the simple way first, learn from it, iterate and build more features on top of it. \"Fail fast\" was a mantra he constantly encouraged his teams to do; meaning, lets put a software out there for customers so they can start using them, gather feedback and improve the user experience later. Under his able leadership, my team delivered several successful projects in a timely manner with very high quality. Tom often spent a lot of time code reviews and offered suggestions on how we could improve code quality and ensure the services are scalable and reliable. I learnt quite a bit of software architecture while working with him. <br><br>He is extremely social and makes work to be a fun and learning experience. He is well respected among his peers and would be an incredible Leader/Manager/Architect to any organization.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ramanathakrishan.jpeg\" alt data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Ram Ananthakrishnan</b><br>Senior Manager - Program and Product</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">I have had the pleasure of working with Tom on several high-visibility Mobile and Omnichannel initiatives. Tom possesses a rare combination of technical skills along with leadership skills. His teams are always high performing thanks to his mentorship/coaching mindset and empathetic approach. Most of all Tom is a great consensus builder. He has a very strong foundation in software engineering/architecture, especially in Mobile and Service-Oriented Architecture. He also has a unique ability to zero in on real user needs and tailor solutions accordingly. He uses those skills to illustrate complex concepts in simple terms to create buy-in within the organization and executive management. I would jump at the chance to work with Tom again!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/klarissamarenitch.jpeg\" alt data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Klarissa Marenitch</b><br>SVP Information Technology</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDuring my tenure at Kohl’s, Tom has been a key contributor to the success of our omni-channel platform and superior in-store experience. He managed several complex initiatives, including in-store associate mobility (his team developed 30+ mobile applications for optimized associate operations), customer pick up , Omni inventory. He has a great combination of skills including engineering managmemt and delivery, solutions architecture background , and people leadership. These qualities combined with drive to excel, makes him an ideal leader for those organizations embarking on digital transformation and growth. I highly recommend Tom! \n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/camsmith.jpeg\" data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\" alt>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Cam Smith</b><br>CTO</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Dedicated and hard working Tom was always the person we turned to when needing to understand new technology, get it up and running and figure out how it fit into our existing technology stack. Tom drove our transition into .NET WPF/WCF, architected a comples rules engine, and then seemlessly moved into leading our mobile initiative. A true team leader Tom could manage, architect or code - whatever it took to keep the project moving and the team engaged. It would be my pleasure to work with Tom again.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/johnhughes.jpeg\" data-slide-to=\"4\" data-bs-slide-to=\"4\" alt>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>John Hughes</b><br>CIO</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Tom is one of those rare technologists... he is highly talented technically but also communicates very well with all levels of a business. He has strong management and leadership abilities and has the ability to translate business needs into the right technology action. I thoroughly enjoyed working with Tom and wouldn't hesitate to hire him again!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
